---
---
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="f-brand">
      <p class="f-logo-en">Angel Center</p>
      <p class="f-logo-ja">ぶっこうどう</p>
      <p class="f-tag">葬儀後の供養事をトータルでサポートする<br>専門の窓口サービスです。</p>
      <address class="f-addr">
        〒XXX-XXXX ○○県○○市○○町X-X-X<br>
        TEL: <a href="tel:0120XXXXXX">0120-XXX-XXX</a><br>
        受付時間 9:00〜18:00（年中無休）
      </address>
    </div>
    <div class="f-links">
      <div class="f-col">
        <h3>SERVICES</h3>
        <a href="/services/estate">遺品整理</a>
        <a href="/services/junk">不用品回収</a>
        <a href="/services/antique">古物買取（4月〜）</a>
        <a href="/services/butsudan">仏壇・仏具販売</a>
        <a href="/services/cemetery">墓地・霊園紹介</a>
      </div>
      <div class="f-col">
        <h3>MORE SERVICES</h3>
        <a href="/services/altar-remake">仏壇リメイク</a>
        <a href="/services/grave-closure">墓じまい</a>
        <a href="/services/grave-keeping">墓守代行</a>
        <a href="/services/ocean">海洋散骨</a>
        <a href="/services/memento">手元供養品販売</a>
      </div>
      <div class="f-col">
        <h3>COMPANY</h3>
        <a href="/about">会社概要</a>
        <a href="/staff">スタッフ紹介</a>
        <a href="/blog">ブログ</a>
        <a href="/voices">お客様の声</a>
        <a href="/contact">お問合せ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="f-btm">© 2026 エンジェルセンター ぶっこうどう All Rights Reserved.</div>
</footer>

<style>
.footer{background:var(--gd);color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);padding:4rem 1.5rem 1.5rem}
.footer-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:3.5rem;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto 2.75rem}
.f-logo-en{font-family:var(--roman);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.17em;font-style:italic;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)}
.f-logo-ja{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.95rem}
.f-tag{font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.95;color:rgba(255,255,255,.62);margin-bottom:1.15rem}
.f-addr{font-style:normal;font-size:.7rem;line-height:2.1;color:rgba(255,255,255,.52)}
.f-addr a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65)}
.f-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.75rem}
.f-col h3{font-family:var(--roman);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.2em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.42);margin-bottom:.85rem;padding-bottom:.42rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.f-col a{display:block;font-size:.73rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);padding:.28rem 0;transition:.15s}
.f-col a:hover{color:#fff}
.f-btm{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);text-align:center;padding-top:1.2rem;font-size:.66rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.38);max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
@media(max-width:1024px){.footer-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .footer{padding:3rem 1rem 1.25rem}
  .footer-inner{gap:2.25rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
  .f-links{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem}
  .f-col:last-child{grid-column:span 2}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  .f-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .f-col:last-child{grid-column:auto}
}
</style>
